From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 06:52:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix build (Tailwind v3 + React 19 deps), harden Supabase RLS,
 working seed, role-based login

---
 README.md                           |   33 +-
 index.html                          |   29 +-
 package-lock.json                   | 6078 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 package.json                        |    9 +-
 pnpm-lock.yaml                      | 4939 ----------------------
 pnpm-workspace.yaml                 |  379 --
 src/globals.css                     |  114 +-
 src/hooks/useAuth.tsx               |   52 +-
 src/pages/Login.tsx                 |   14 +-
 src/pages/Signup.tsx                |    8 +-
 supabase/002_security_hardening.sql |  366 ++
 supabase/seed.sql                   |  420 +-
 tailwind.config.ts                  |   34 +-
 tsconfig.app.json                   |    1 -
 vite.config.ts                      |   33 +-
